IMPORTANT POINT TO REMEMBER --> Lists are flexible, tuples are fixed, dictionaries connect keys to values and sets remove duplicates.

2. What is a List ?
Solution. A list store multiple values in a single variable.

Code (WITHOUT THE LIST):

